<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/XmlSchema-instance"
       xmlns:mstts="https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts"
       xml:lang="en-US">

  <!-- INTRO — Cheerful and energetic -->
  <mstts:express-as style="cheerful">
    Welcome! <break time="400ms"/>
    I am <emphasis level="strong">so</emphasis> excited to show you this home today.
    <break time="300ms"/>
    I think you are genuinely going to fall in love with it.
  </mstts:express-as>

  <break strength="strong"/>

  <!-- EXTERIOR -->
  <mstts:express-as style="cheerful">
    First, let's talk about what you see right here —
    <break time="300ms"/>
    the <emphasis level="strong">curb appeal</emphasis>.
    <break time="200ms"/>
    That gorgeous stone facade, the mature oak trees lining the driveway —
    <prosody pitch="+8%" rate="95%">absolutely stunning.</prosody>
    <break time="400ms"/>
    And the front porch? Perfect for your morning coffee.
    <break time="200ms"/>
    Just <emphasis level="moderate">imagine</emphasis> sitting out here on a Sunday.
  </mstts:express-as>

  <break strength="x-strong"/>

  <!-- FOYER — Building anticipation -->
  Now, as we step inside —
  <break time="600ms"/>
  <prosody pitch="+5%" rate="90%">
    take a moment to just <emphasis level="strong">take it all in.</emphasis>
  </prosody>
  <break time="500ms"/>
  That ceiling is <emphasis level="moderate">eighteen feet</emphasis> high.
  <break time="300ms"/>
  And this <emphasis level="moderate">natural light</emphasis> flooding in from the skylight above —
  <break time="400ms"/>
  you simply cannot fake that.

  <break strength="strong"/>

  <!-- LIVING ROOM — Conversational and warm -->
  <mstts:express-as style="cheerful">
    Moving into the living room — oh, and <emphasis level="strong">wow</emphasis> —
    <break time="300ms"/>
    look at that <prosody pitch="+6%">fireplace.</prosody>
    <break time="200ms"/>
    Original brick, fully restored. <break time="300ms"/>
    This is the kind of space where memories get made.
  </mstts:express-as>

  <break strength="strong"/>

  <!-- KITCHEN — Enthusiastic -->
  <mstts:express-as style="cheerful">
    And now — <break time="400ms"/> the kitchen.
    <break time="300ms"/>
    I know, I <emphasis level="strong">know</emphasis> —
    <prosody pitch="+10%" rate="105%">it is incredible.</prosody>
    <break time="400ms"/>
  </mstts:express-as>

  Quartz countertops, <break time="200ms"/>
  a <emphasis level="moderate">waterfall island</emphasis> that seats four comfortably,
  <break time="300ms"/>
  and <prosody rate="90%">top-of-the-line stainless appliances</prosody> — all included.
  <break time="400ms"/>
  The walk-in pantry alone is bigger than most studio apartments I have seen.

  <break strength="x-strong"/>

  <!-- A GENTLE HEADS UP — Slightly subdued -->
  Now, <break time="300ms"/>
  I do want to be <emphasis level="moderate">upfront</emphasis> with you.
  <break time="300ms"/>
  The primary bathroom is currently being <emphasis level="reduced">renovated</emphasis>.
  <break time="400ms"/>
  So what you see there today is mid-construction —
  <break time="300ms"/>
  but the finishes selected are <prosody pitch="+5%">absolutely gorgeous</prosody>
  and it will be fully complete before closing.

  <break strength="strong"/>

  <!-- PRIMARY BEDROOM — Whisper moment -->
  <mstts:express-as style="cheerful">
    Now follow me down the hall — <break time="300ms"/>
    and brace yourself —
    <break time="500ms"/>
  </mstts:express-as>

  <mstts:express-as style="whisper">
    this is the primary suite.
  </mstts:express-as>

  <break time="600ms"/>

  <prosody pitch="+6%" rate="92%">
    Over eight hundred square feet. <break time="300ms"/>
    Private balcony. <break time="300ms"/>
    His and hers walk-in closets.
  </prosody>
  <break time="400ms"/>
  And that view of the backyard and the tree line beyond —
  <break time="300ms"/>
  <emphasis level="strong">there is nothing like waking up to that every single morning.</emphasis>

  <break strength="x-strong"/>

  <!-- BACKYARD — Building to a close -->
  <mstts:express-as style="cheerful">
    And finally — <break time="400ms"/> the backyard.
    <break time="500ms"/>
    Half an acre, fully fenced, with a <emphasis level="strong">heated saltwater pool</emphasis>
    <break time="200ms"/>
    and an outdoor kitchen that is fully plumbed and wired.
    <break time="400ms"/>
    Summer entertaining? <break time="300ms"/>
    <prosody pitch="+12%" rate="108%">Done and done.</prosody>
  </mstts:express-as>

  <break strength="x-strong"/>

  <!-- CLOSE — Warm and confident -->
  So — <break time="400ms"/>
  whether you are looking for a place to <emphasis level="moderate">raise a family</emphasis>,
  <break time="200ms"/>
  to <emphasis level="moderate">entertain in style</emphasis>,
  <break time="200ms"/>
  or simply to have a home that truly feels like a <emphasis level="strong">sanctuary</emphasis> —
  <break time="500ms"/>
  <prosody pitch="+5%" rate="93%">
    this property checks every single box.
  </prosody>

  <break time="400ms"/>

  <mstts:express-as style="cheerful">
    I would love to hear your thoughts. <break time="300ms"/>
    What questions do you have for me?
  </mstts:express-as>

</speak>
